    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "No. 30 Hawthorn Park is a most impressive three-bedroom semi-detached home presented in excellent condition throughout. Ideally located within the sought-after Hawthorn Park development, the property is only minutes’ walk to Swords Main Street. All amenities are on your doorstep including bus routes, schools, shops, restaurants and the Pavilions Shopping Centre. The spacious accommodation extends to 106 sq.m. and comprises entrance porch, entrance hall, guest toilet, dual aspect living/dining room and kitchen/breakfast room. Upstairs there are three bedrooms, main bedroom with en suite and the family bathroom. Viewing is highly recommended.\r\n\r\n* Bright & spacious accommodation extending to 106 sq.m.\r\n* Minutes’ walk to Swords Main Street\r\n* Excellent condition throughout\r\n* Mature, sought after development\r\n* Dual aspect living/dining room \r\n* Adjacent to large open green spaces\r\n* Guest toilet, en suite & family bathroom\r\n* Large insulated and floored attic, with great conversion potential\r\n* Double glazed windows throughout\r\n* Gas fired central heating\r\n* Spacious front garden with driveway for off street parking\r\n* Walking distance to Swords Main Street, Pavillions Shopping Centre, Schools, Swords & Airside Business Parks \r\n* Adjacent to bus routes including Dublin Bus & Swords Express \r\n* Easy access to Dublin Airport, Airside Retail Park, M1 & M50 motorways \r\n* Within close proximity to a host of parks and sporting clubs in both Swords & Malahide \r\n* Primary Schools close by:\r\nRivervalley Community National School,\r\nSt Colmcilles Primary Schools, The Old Borough National School, \r\nSt Cronan’s Junior National School, Holy Family National School, \r\nSwords Educate Together National School\r\nGaelscoil Brian Boroimhe\r\nBroadmeadow CNS\r\n* Secondary Schools close by:\r\nLoreto College\r\nColaiste Choilm\r\nSt Finian’s Community College\r\nFingal Community College\r\nSwords Community College"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "GROUND FLOOR:\r\n\r\nEntrance porch   -   Sliding door.\r\n\r\nEntrance Hall   -   Laminate flooring. Guest toilet off.\r\n\r\nGuest toilet   -   2.2m x 0.8m\r\nVinyl floor. Toilet, sink and window.\t\t\t\r\n\r\nLiving / Dining room   -   9.3m x 3.6m\r\nDual aspect. Laminate flooring. Feature fireplace with open fire. Bay window. Sliding door to rear garden.\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\r\nKitchen / Breakfast room   -   5.1m x 2.7m\r\nTimber kitchen fitted. Tiled floor and part tiled walls. Door to rear garden.\r\n\r\nFIRST FLOOR:\r\n\r\nLanding   -   Hotpress. Carpet fitted.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1   -   5.1m x 3.2m (front right)\r\nDouble room with built in wardrobes. Carpet fitted. Bay Window. En suite off.\r\n\r\nEn suite   -   1.3m x 3.2m\r\nTimber floor. Shower, toilet and sink. Sky light.\r\n\t\t\t \r\nBedroom 2   -   3.4m x 3.6m (rear)\r\nDouble room with built in wardrobes and vanity. Carpet fitted.\r\n\t\t\r\nBedroom 3   -   3.0m x 2.3m (front left)\r\nSingle room with built in shelving and wardrobe. Carpet fitted.\r\n\r\nBathroom   -   2.4m x 1.8m\r\nTimber floor. Part tiled walls. Bath, toilet, sink and window.\r\n\r\nOUTSIDE:\r\nFront garden with driveway for off street parking and pedestrian side entrance leading to the private rear garden. Adjacent to large open green spaces."
      },
